        <Text>
          <style>Title</style>
          <text>Audio v0.11 - LV controller prepass and lazy piano events</text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
          <style>Subtitle</style>
          <size>10</size>
          <text>The repeated C chain ends with LV. The final G has no LV or tie dependency.
The controller prepass must leave the final G play events untouched until ordinary playback rendering.</text>
        </Text>
